    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">70 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Build it yourself: 90 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Machine coding case</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Rank 44 of the LLD question list</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Traffic Signal Controller</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">A four-way junction where the lights must cycle green, yellow and red, never show green to two crossing roads, give pedestrians time to walk, adapt the green time to real queue data (the Goldman Sachs version) and let an ambulance through at once. You build a signal that refuses unsafe changes, a controller with five State classes, a pluggable timing Strategy, an emergency queue, a fault mode and a conflict monitor that proves safety. Java, Python and C++14 code all run.</p>\n"
  },
